WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
1 / Nucleation
All three start with similar molten material. Crystal nuclei begin growing.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
2 / Crystal growth
Slow cooling allows large crystals; rapid cooling leaves little growth time.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
3 / Texture preserves the cooling history
A slow first stage grows phenocrysts. Faster cooling then fills the spaces with small crystals.
